{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國軍方最大雲平台之一首次被公開披露遭突破，事件發生在平台升級期間，目前尚不清楚攻擊者的身份，也無法確認其是否實際獲取了數據。美國空軍回應，不對「特定網絡與系統的安全態勢、漏洞或運行狀態」置評，強調持續採取審慎措施保護空軍部信息、系統與任務能力。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1588274.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T07:15:08.931697+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T06:48:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T07:08:32.082806+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T07:08:32.082806+00:00","content_hash":"c61d7dc05866d485b8be5a3169cb6c95bbb4b2f77529a03e7288dd4fdd9ff705","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}